# Boughside Wanderers, a 4/4: "When this creature enters, look at the top four cards of your library. You may reveal a permanent
# card from among them and put it into your hand. Put the rest on the bottom of your library in a random order. Landfall - Whenever
# a land you control enters, this creature gets +2/+2 until end of turn." The top four are Lightning Bolt, Giant Growth, Ornithopter
# and Plains (fourth); the fifth, a Mountain, is not looked at (CR 701.20a: exactly four). Bot1 may not take the instant or the
# sorcery (CR 110.4a: no permanent cards), takes the Ornithopter revealing it, and the other three go to the bottom with the Mountain
# the new top card (more than one permanent card may not be taken). Then a Forest enters: 6/6 (+2/+2, CR 611.2); on turn 2 Bot2's land gives nothing and the pump has ended (4/4);
# on turn 3 Bot1's land makes it 6/6 again.

